        <p class="indent">
        The most easiest way to install the library is to upload it from the preference page of the @PLUGIN_NAME@ 
        plug-in. However that requires that you are allowed to start a FTP connection to your host.
        <p>
        Take these steps to use the embedded installer:
        <ul>
        <li>Goto 'Window -> Preferences'.</li>
        <li>Select '@PLUGIN_NAME@ -> Library'.</li>
        <li>Click the [Transfer @PLUGIN_NAME@ Library] button.</li>
        <li>Select a connection.</li>
        <li>Click the [Start Transfer] button.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
        Refer to the @PLUGIN_NAME@ <a target="_help" href="@HELP_URL@">help</a> page to see more options for installing the library.